---
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { ROUTES } from '../config/site';
import { ABOUT_LEAD, LEGAL_UPDATED } from '../data/content/legal-pages';
---

<LegalPage routeKey="about" h1="About Us" lead={ABOUT_LEAD} updated={LEGAL_UPDATED}>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>
    Hospital Bag Checklist is a free resource for parents preparing for birth. We publish practical
    packing guides for mom, baby and dad, plus a personalised checklist tool that adapts to your
    delivery plan, hospital stay and who you are packing for.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our goal is simple: reduce the mental load in the last weeks of pregnancy. You should spend less
    time guessing what belongs in your bag and more time resting before the big day.
  </p>

  <h2>How our content is written</h2>
  <p>
    Our checklists are based on common hospital packing advice, feedback from parents, and what
    people actually use during labor and recovery. Every hospital is different — what one unit
    provides for free, another may ask you to bring — so we always recommend confirming details
    with your midwife, doctor or maternity unit.
  </p>
  <p>
    We update guides when we find clearer ways to explain packing or when hospital practices
    change. If you spot something outdated, please <a href={ROUTES.contact.path}>let us know</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    This site is for general information only. It is not a substitute for professional medical
    advice, diagnosis or treatment. Always follow the guidance of your healthcare team.
  </p>

  <h2>Explore the checklists</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={ROUTES.mom.path}>Hospital bag checklist for mom</a></li>
    <li><a href={ROUTES.baby.path}>Baby hospital bag checklist</a></li>
    <li><a href={ROUTES.dad.path}>Hospital bag checklist for dad</a></li>
    <li><a href={ROUTES.pregnancy.path}>When to pack your hospital bag</a></li>
    <li><a href={ROUTES.generator.path}>Create your personalised checklist</a></li>
  </ul>
</LegalPage>
